{{Term/Store|Sheik's Mask||Series, BotW, TotK}},{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/> also known as the {{Term/Store|Sheik Mask||SSBfN3DS, SSBfWU, SSBU}},{{Exp Game|SSBfN3DS, SSBfWU, SSBU}}<ref name="SSBfN3DS Headgear"/><ref name="SSBfWU Headgear"/><ref name="SSBU Select Headgear"/> is a recurring [[Item]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
Sheik's Mask is a piece of [[Armor]] which can be obtained using the [[Amiibo (Ability)|amiibo]] [[Rune]] while scanning the {{SSB}} [[Sheik]] [[amiibo]]. Wearing Sheik's Mask will grant [[Link]] [[Stealth Up]].

====Enhancing====
{{Armor Levels|BotW|Sheik's Mask}}

==={{TotK|-}}===
{{Descriptions TotK}}
Sheik's Mask is a piece of [[Armor]] which can be obtained by completing the [[Desert Coliseum]]. Sheik's Mask can also be obtained by using the [[Amiibo (Ability)|amiibo]] [[Ancient Power]]. Wearing Sheik's Mask will provide [[Link]] [[Stealth Up]].

